step Tunk and Zalfan Moonshadow
  tip Two foes no boss list names. Tunk, an elite, drops the Krol'dok Moulding, which starts a quest for Alphonse Dumas at Farholde Keep. Zalfan Moonshadow is Ranath Nightstride's quarry.
  collect 267138 @37.5,38.2 group 5
  accept 94980 @37.5,38.2
  kill 268423 quest 96771.1 @37.5,38.2 group 5

step Nar'gurk
  tip Slavecrusher Grox, Twilight Commander Zarmok and Handler Ashka come before him in the client's journal. He drops the Tome of Twilight.
  collect 267104 quest 94984.1 @37.5,38.2 group 5

step Overseer Mugg
  tip The last boss in the client's journal. The Eye of Mugg is the proof Demar Brant wants.
  collect 267086 quest 94982.1 @37.5,38.2 group 5

